  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/055L">Situation <span data-tag="055L">37.29.1</span>.</a> Here $f : X \to Y$ be a morphism of schemes, and $s : Y \to X$ is a section of $f$. For every $y \in Y$ we denote $X^0_ y$ the connected component of $X_ y$ containing $s(y)$. Finally, we set $X^0 = \bigcup _{y \in Y} X^0_ y$. </p>
